                    %mi c
                    %mi k
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} c = \sum_{i = 1}^n c_k
            the formal sum of all the Chern classes, and using the fact that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elementary+symmetric+polynomials"} elementary symmetric polynomials
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
